Bilkul, sorry! Chaliye step-by-step samajhta hoon:
1. Pehle aap kis branch pe the?
UI-side-navbar-modification — yani aap ek alag branch pe kaam kar rahe the jo main se alag hai.
2. Aapne kya bola?
Aapne kaha: "main pe switch karo, lekin current branch safe rahe taaki baad mein wapas aa sakoon."
3. Maine kya kiya — do cheezein:
Step 1 — Stash kiya (git stash)
- Jab aap branch switch karte hain, agar aapne kuch changes kiya hai (jo abhi commit nahi kiye), toh woh changes saath nahi jaate. Git aapko branch switch karne nahi dega agar unsaved changes hain.
- Isliye maine woh unsaved changes utha kar ek temporary safe jagah rakh di. Isse kehte hain stash.
- Stash ka matlab: "apne kaam ko side rakh do, baad mein wapas laaunga."
- Maine stash ko ek naam diya: "WIP: UI-side-navbar-modification - sidebar border and globals changes" — taaki aapko pata ho yeh kis branch ka kaam hai.
Step 2 — main pe switch kiya (git checkout main)
- Ab jab saare changes safe stash ho gaye, toh maine main branch pe switch kar diya.
4. Wapas kaise aaoge?
Jab wapas us branch pe kaam karna ho:
git checkout UI-side-navbar-modification
git stash pop
- git checkout — aap wapas apni branch pe chale jaaoge.
- git stash pop — jo kaam temporary rakhwaya tha, woh wapas laakar files mein daal dega.
Short me: Aapke adhoore kaam ko utha kar almari mein rakh diya, branch change kiya, aur jab wapas aaoge toh almari se nikaal kar wapas table pe rakh dunga.
