Nahi, WIP koi alag command nahi hai. Do cheezein ek saath hui:
git stash push -m "WIP: UI-side-navbar-modification - sidebar border and globals changes"
Yeh ek hi command hai jisme:
- git stash push — stash create karta hai (unsaved changes safe rakhta hai)
- -m "message..." — stash ko ek label/naam deta hai, taaki pata rahe yeh kis cheez ka stash hai
- WIP ka matlab Work In Progress — ek common convention hai, koi command nahi
Toh uss time bas ek hi command chali — git stash push -m "..." baaki sab sirf uss command ka description/label tha.
